              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "I'm nuts too"
            },
            "reviewBody": "loved it! used sazon spice instead of the tumeric (didn't have tumeric) and a small can of tomato sauce in lieu of the ketchup. Added fresh garlic and chopped cilantro and it was awesome! thx for the post Sandy :)",
